			"notes": {
				"rationale": "die ganze Zeit makes the eyes' closed state last, so the clause reports no event of closing: hat is the VERB haben on its own (de/sein-perfect-or-copula, ADR 0036 amended on #653). Minimal pair: de/er-hat-ploetzlich-die-augen-geschlossen. die Augen geschlossen haben is 'have something in a state', the 'have' Reading of Wir hätten gern mehr Zeit under ADR 0031; geschlossen carries the state."
			},
